.env*
# The self-hosted bundle's env template is a real, checked-in deployment
# artifact (empty/placeholder values, same as the top-level .env.example
# this is copied from) — not a secret the blanket .env* rule above should
# catch. Path-qualified so this doesn't un-ignore any other .env.production
# a developer might create locally.
!deploy/self-hosted-bundle/.env.production.example

